        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el Pokémon que la lleva tiene los PS al máximo,\npuede resistir un golpe que lo dejaría K. O. y se queda\ncon 1 PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nSe il Pokémon ha tutti i PS, eviterà un\npotenziale KO, rimanendo con un PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. If the holder has\nfull HP, it will endure a potential KO attack with\n1 HP. The item then disappears.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　ＨＰが　満タンのとき\nひんしになりそうな　技を　受けても\nＨＰ１で　１度だけ　耐える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带后，在ＨＰ全满时，\n即便受到可能会导致濒死的招式，\n也能仅以１ＨＰ撑过去１次。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
